<h1>UX</h1><p>On open, doesn't put the cursor in the doc.</p><p></p><h1>Search</h1><p>CTRL+F</p><p></p><h1>Change-tracking conflicts</h1><p>Agent-created HD's don't necessarily have version, MUID, etc. Ideally these can be created through skill scripts to ensure consistency before the viewer opens and edits them? Currently we have a conflict where both are editing the doc and the user doesn't know what's changed. Importance since both the agent and the user can be working on a doc.</p><p>? is date causing issues, is the UI constantly updating it? Should use file date instead.</p><h2>Look at better multi-user caps-</h2><p>Agent edits doc- viewer immediately highlights those changes for visibility.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><h1>Consider</h1><p>Auto move detection and auto relinking?</p><p></p><p></p>